# SQLite + data (per ADR-0001: data/ holds seed yaml and runtime DBs).
# data/ is gitignored wholesale. The one exception is
# data/snapshots/noic-fixture.yaml — committed with `git add -f`
# because M2.T3's NOIC scraper needs a checked-in source fixture
# that lives alongside the runtime snapshots it produces.
data/
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

